================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATA AND SOFTWARE NOTICES
================================================================================

Dictionary data distributed with BambooMintKey (`dicts/vietnamese-syllables-mit.dict`,
`dicts/english-20k.dict`) is generated and cleaned within this project from a
phonotactic matrix and an open corpus, and is released under the MIT License /
Creative Commons Zero (CC0). See `scripts/generate_mit_dict.py` and
`docs/2.Design/Phase8/008_02_MIT_Dictionary_And_Corpus_Design.md`.

The following sources are used ONLY as corpus reference during data
generation/filtering and are NOT embedded or redistributed in the binary.

1. IBus-Bamboo (Vietnamese Syllable Dictionary)
   - Source: https://github.com/BambooEngine/ibus-bamboo
   - Author: Luong Thanh Lam and IBus-Bamboo contributors
   - Data File: vietnamese.cm.dict
   - License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

2. Vietnamese Wordlist - Viet74K (Vietnamese Compound Words)
   - Source: https://github.com/duyet/vietnamese-wordlist
   - Author / Compiler: Ho Ngoc Duc, Tran Huu Duyet
   - Data File: Viet74K.txt
   - Original URL: http://www.informatik.uni-leipzig.de/~duc/software/misc/wordlist.html
   - License: GNU General Public License (GPL)

3. Google 20,000 English Words (English Frequency Wordlist)
   - Source: https://github.com/first20hours/google-10000-english
   - Derived from: Google Web Trillion Word Corpus (Peter Norvig)
   - Author / Maintainer: Josh Kaufman (first20hours)
   - Data File: 20k.txt
   - License: MIT License / Public Domain (Open Data)

4. Vietnamese Wikipedia (Open Corpus)
   - Source: https://dumps.wikimedia.org/viwiki/
   - License: CC BY-SA 3.0 / CC0 (text corpus for syllable frequency filtering)
